            <ArticleTitle>[Advance in molecular biology of Dendrobium (Orchidaceae)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2753-2761</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4268/cjcmm20161502</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>With the development of molecular biology, the process in molecular biology research of Dendrobium is going fast. Not only did it provide new ways to identify Dendrobium quickly, reveal the genetic diversity and relationship of Dendrobium, but also lay the vital foundation for explaining the mechanism of Dendrobium growth and metabolism. The present paper reviews the recent process in molecular biology research of Dendrobium from three aspects, including molecular identification, genetic diversity and functional genes. And this review will facilitate the development of this research area and Dendrobium.</AbstractText>
